{"availability":"available","full":"xorvion-ai/Alex-ai","name":"Alex-ai","description":"Finds small businesses with no website anywhere on Earth, AI-scores each lead, and drafts the outreach to sell them one — runs at $0/month.","category":"Business","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-18T22:20:15Z","updated":"2026-10-08T18:26:25Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://alex-ai-xorvion.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://alex-ai-xorvion.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:29.829Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:29.829Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:29.829Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T23:43:29.829Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Alex.ai is a full-stack, agentic lead-generation system by Xorvion. It sweeps three independent map worlds — Google Maps, OpenStreetMap, and TomTom — for small businesses with no website, anywhere on Earth, verifies them across the open web, deep-analyzes each one with AI, and manages the whole pipeline until the lead is contacted. Built to run at $0/month, forever, with a quota guardian that makes a bill impossible.","Sign in, point it at any city, and watch qualified leads stream in — each with a score, a website plan, and outreach drafts in the lead's own language.","Xorvion is an independent AI studio created by Sumit Kumar. Xorvion designs, builds, and ships AI products end-to-end — from multi-agent orchestration and free-tier-first architecture to auth, persistence, and the design system. Alex.ai is one of its flagship builds."],"features":["Triple-source discovery — Google Places API (New) + OpenStreetMap Overpass + TomTom Search sweep the same city and de-duplicate against each other; a Facebook-page-only \"website\" is detected and tagged SOCIAL (often the…","Web-wide verification — Tavily confirms a lead truly has no website anywhere online and harvests their social links as extra contact channels.","AI deep analysis — Gemini Flash Lite scores every lead 0–100 with explainable reasoning, writes a business profile from real Google reviews, a website plan (COPY PLAN FOR CLAUDE → paste into Claude to build the actual…","CRM-lite pipeline — filters, live search, CSV export, activity log, follow-up reminders with a due-today dashboard, one-tap CALL / WhatsApp.","Delete-on-contact — ✓ CONTACTED archives a full snapshot to a downloadable history CSV and removes the lead; the pipeline only ever contains live prospects."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/xorvion-ai/Alex-ai/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"447b13490e106241485763843b92402820cca9df36613f0579fc0e0ff12f81c3","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:29.993Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:29.993Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Alex.ai is a full-stack, agentic lead-generation system by Xorvion. It sweeps three independent map worlds — Google Maps, OpenStreetMap, and TomTom — for small businesses with no website, anywhere on Earth, verifies them across the open web, deep-analyzes each one with AI, and manages the whole pipeline until the lead is contacted. Built to run at $0/month, forever, with a quota guardian that makes a bill impossible.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/xorvion-ai/Alex-ai/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Sign in, point it at any city, and watch qualified leads stream in — each with a score, a website plan, and outreach drafts in the lead's own language.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/xorvion-ai/Alex-ai/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"447b13490e106241485763843b92402820cca9df36613f0579fc0e0ff12f81c3","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/xorvion-ai/Alex-ai/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:29.993Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T18:26:25Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/xorvion-ai/Alex-ai/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt"